Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go catch what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a winter fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Only we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't want to\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you cannot achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, and you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine like a star to be good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that you can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.92,0:02:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo is quite formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you find this intel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you work with?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Saru.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a call from the\Nlookout ship on Minion Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Beryl's hideout is on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.35,0:03:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to investigate it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.34,0:03:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Call them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If the pirates find out we sent\Nbattleships, then the deal is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Check the coastal area instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.04,0:03:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Report to me if you see anyone suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma ’am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We can worry about our injuries later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a five-billion berry deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get that fruit back right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.12,0:03:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:03:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it back after all. Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought a surprise with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard gunshots and saw\Nthe building burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so i thought something\Nmight have happened to you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,hey can i get a smile\Nand a thank you we did it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,pal i'm gonna save your\Nlife you should be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah but even if i eat that devil\Nfruit i i might not get better right
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.16,0:04:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll get better so open wide law eat\Nup and heal up what are you waiting for
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it's gross i don't care just eat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the damn thing you chew and swallow
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair. Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.64,0:05:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have weird powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even ask for this, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Karoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I did my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you can go cure yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We just outsmarted Doflamingo.\NWhy in the snow? He'll get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you worn out or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me turn you over!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're covered in blood! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone shoot you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I got clumsy. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you say something sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You better! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get better!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop pleading!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop pleading!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.78,0:06:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, you need knowledge to\Nmake the Op-Op powers work. Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You got shot because of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to fix this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Law, don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't die from something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kara!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But we still need to staunch the\Nbleeding, or I'll be in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the op-op through\Njust like I said we would.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's gonna take more than\Nthat to stop Duffy in his tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're in bad shape,\Nbut I need to ask a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a Navy lookout ship on\Nthe west coast of this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this and hand this over to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a trick; if a marine sees this,\Nthey would know exactly what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This one little package will save a country,\Na faraway kingdom called Dress Rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I told you before\Nhow much I hate the navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father was a great doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right as soon as you deliver\Nthis, we'll get off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, we can travel the\Nworld together, just you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, he's alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, hmm, a secret message.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.16,0:08:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who gave this\Nto you, but I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of\Nthis, so don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But you sound kind of\Nsick—kid—are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I, uh—huh—like I said, I'll make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,said I'll make sure that\Nletter gets to the right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.32,0:08:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, listen, I need you to help someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He was shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.68,0:08:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in really bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I would do if he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He got hurt because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:09:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I found someone to give you first aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.86,0:09:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Vergo, Corazon, what\Nare you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just talk? Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So that was his secret mission, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there? Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,an extremely powerful\Nindividual right now—he's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,away from the family\Non a secret operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but the details of that\Nare between him and Dofi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy has nothing to do\Nwith you, so forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you dare that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,was infiltrating the Navy all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What a sick joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There are probably\Nthousands of marines here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And somehow this bastard gets the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,get the message loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Give
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cora—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Give
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it away, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,work for Doflamingo, and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,how would you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it—you must be that new\Nboy, Law from the White Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dofi told
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,me all about you, about how\Nyou two ran off—traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to learn some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid—if you know my position, then you\Nshould have the sense to call me Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.35,0:10:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You really spilled the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,beans in this secret report of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy got a hold of info like this\Nand that would be the end of the family,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but we have so much unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.02,0:11:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You will betray the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,family over one child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.94,0:11:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing but a rat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A disgrace. That's the second Corazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I didn't suspect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember when you were\Neight and went missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,only to show up again 14 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If it was up to me, I would have\Nturned you away on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But Duffy trusted you, because\Nyou're his brother after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You earned this fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nora!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.18,0:12:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't kill them, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So what did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Corazon was a spy for the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been working with them on\Na plot to take out the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.54,0:12:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're probably on to\Nour Devil Fruit plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.30,0:12:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was watching the rendezvous\Nspot on Swallow Island earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.72,0:13:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but I noticed two warships\Napproach from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I couldn't hide\Nfrom the truth anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet little brother was\Nbearing his fangs at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Although that's unfortunate, it did\Nremind me of something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are my real family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I had to face\Nreality sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we're at\NMinion Island right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.60,0:13:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Close to you, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pity we didn't arrive here a bit sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing we saw when\Nwe got here was a bunch of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Beryl's pirates screaming about\Nthe Devil Fruit being stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Corazon's work. I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, don't let him go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He has the abob fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll make sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, ran away already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're still\Non the island, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:14:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hunt them down soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, you seen this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.94,0:14:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those things are sharp as a knife\Nand rock solid too, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone trapped us in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,One of Dofi's abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I would imagine; I've\Nnever seen it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But one thing is perfectly\Nclear: there's nowhere to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using the parasite string, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're locked in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.58,0:15:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cora, what's going on? Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can save myself,\Nbut maybe I can still save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This may be the end of the road, but I\Nhope you'll remember me when I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And promise I'll go out with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not worth much, but if\Nyou do think back on me someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather you remember me smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get moving, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Duffy, this is our boss. So this one\Nlittle guy knocked everyone out cold, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have some powerful Haki
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, you can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.68,0:16:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop living!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop living! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you take my power from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to give you\Nthe strength to take revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, we have to live with\Nthis mess you put us in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless I take your head back\Nto the Holy Land, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do Flamingo, Rosinante,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you have a very foolish father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's madness. I don't\Nknow how to describe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, the whole town was\Nsurrounded by some kind of giant cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get in and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:18:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates went insane;\Nthey're screaming and running!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and cutting each other down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.38,0:18:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,3A, don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You got to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be some way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the dog you're holding for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,3A, damn, where the hell\Ndid that brat run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's life or death and he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess our strongest fighter\Nis our biggest coward, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to make...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the bastard who ran\Noff with our op-op fruit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who ran off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.68,0:18:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here, you drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.44,0:18:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't lost it, I'd be\Ntaking that fruit right now. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start hauling these away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.84,0:19:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you grab\Nevery last big cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pretty loaded\Nfor a bunch of chumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.60,0:19:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We still need to find Corazon, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.04,0:19:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Buffalo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you spotted anything yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's burned to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's any survivors,\NI sure don't see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Search for any possible victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We took a boy into protective\Ncustody at the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy said they took\Na boy into custody!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you! Dorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like Gladius ran into Corazon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.28,0:19:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Lar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay still and they won't find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a trick that always\Nworks against pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw Corazon go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lao-G, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.78,0:20:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I open this lid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.36,0:20:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something sitting on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.18,0:20:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Mertz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you been pretending that\Nyou can't talk all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.42,0:20:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I've got nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.44,0:20:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to garbage like you punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Insolence!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.92,0:21:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a fool of the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done enough, Gladius.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't have him die before\Nthe young master arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.30,0:21:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to lure the\NNavy into an Alto war with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.16,0:21:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,weren't you, you lying bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.98,0:21:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite the little villain, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the Young Master's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.04,0:21:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you in\Nsix months, Korra's Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.54,0:22:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nowhere to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.74,0:22:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're safe with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.62,0:22:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Marine Code 0-1-7-4-6.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.62,0:22:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocinante.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander from HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.06,0:22:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain of the Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.42,0:22:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been working undercover to\Nprevent a tragedy of your making.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That has been my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.54,0:23:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I lied to you. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.74,0:23:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want you to hate me, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you saying this now? I\Nalready knew, of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,an apology you really\Nthink we'll show mercy on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.00,0:23:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you now i don't have the\Npatience for your insipid
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.14,0:23:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,little jokes so you'd\Nbetter answer my questions
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.38,0:23:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,now where's the op-op\Nfruit and where is law
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.14,0:23:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's long gone. Law ate it\Nright up. In other words, he's a
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.38,0:23:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,power holder that's how he was\Nable to get out of your cage
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.40,0:23:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a navy lookout ship\Nnearby that probably took him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.30,0:24:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,into protective custody already\Nwhich means he's safe from you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.46,0:24:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,why didn't you tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.54,0:24:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,sooner this is urgent
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I got here as fast\Nas I can. We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.32,0:24:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.86,0:24:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky coincidence, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.66,0:24:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Law is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.66,0:24:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll undo the birdcage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.64,0:24:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Go check into that, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.76,0:24:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that fate is conspiring\Nto keep you alive, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.48,0:24:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One guardian angel after another\Nkeeps swooping in to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.36,0:24:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, prepare to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.90,0:24:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If what we just heard was true,\Nwe need to attack that Navy ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.32,0:24:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll take back Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.02,0:24:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.62,0:24:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.28,0:24:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What would I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.68,0:24:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If Law ate the Abob fruit like you\Nsaid, he needs to be educated properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:25:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the boy can die for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You really have gone out of your way\Nto cause me trouble, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.46,0:25:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you insist on undermining your\Nbrother? Why are you forcing me to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.32,0:25:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,kill my own flesh and blood yet again you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.10,0:25:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,point that gun but I know you can't shoot
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.84,0:25:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,me because in the end you're just like
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.32,0:25:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,your father when a pirate sees a treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.14,0:25:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,chest like that one it\Ncan't resist picking
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.58,0:25:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it up and taking it on\Ntheir ship with them
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.34,0:25:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that means as long as you stay in here\Nyou'll definitely have a chance to get out
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.78,0:25:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,of this cage so don't move what about you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.84,0:25:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that's okay you ate the fruit that's the
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.16,0:25:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,only thing dopey's really interested in\Nbesides he and i are brothers remember he
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.36,0:25:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,might get mad sure but it's not like he's
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.54,0:26:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna kill his own\Nflesh and blood and calm
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.24,0:26:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,now even if you rumble around\Nin there it won't make any noise
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.24,0:26:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll see you in the next town
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.76,0:26:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,all right hey law i love you kid
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.24,0:26:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,this is not what you promised me at all\NKaroo you said he wasn't gonna kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.36,0:26:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Law wouldn't obey you\Nanyway, Duffy. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.06,0:26:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He only had three years to live, and he\Nknew that, but he kept fighting anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.86,0:26:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He grew much stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.76,0:26:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He found himself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the same lost child who threw\Nhimself before a killer like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.02,0:27:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to gain from someone\Nwho only longs for destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.44,0:27:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's above that, so you leave him the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,hell alone cuz laws finally free now
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.54,0:27:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You say that again, who\Ndid you call the monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.44,0:27:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.20,0:27:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Slept well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.48,0:27:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.50,0:28:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.50,0:28:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to survive just\Na little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.18,0:28:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull the ship over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.52,0:28:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I die now, the spell I\Ncast will be broken in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.38,0:28:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you cry or make a single noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.12,0:28:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone on the island might hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.06,0:28:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick yourself up, law.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.38,0:28:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Go silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.32,0:28:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Unseen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.84,0:28:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.20,0:28:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.38,0:28:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to bite you down anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.38,0:28:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the iron borders of Whitetown
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.14,0:28:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the sickness that haunted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.96,0:29:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life is finally your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.28,0:29:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.52,0:29:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Zuru's warship damn it
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.66,0:29:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't be sad you're free now
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.96,0:29:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
